     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Version 0.9.14 of Nvim-R was released. The <a href=\"https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28XwZ7xuIEb_-CdBdwMra_\">github repository</a> now includes a <a href=\"https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R/tree/stable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R/tree/stable&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zDFZ7mxltjsPKFDYh72Om\">stable branch</a> that will receive bug fixes. I still added the Vimball to <a href=\"http://vim.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vim.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bwq918c7YsdAyvh9PG_NM\">vim.org</a>, but the best way of using a stable release now is installing <a href=\"https://github.com/junegunn/vim-plug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/junegunn/vim-plug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19XINI0r5lK6WtTUVmoIMt\">vim-plug</a> (or another package manager that can select specific branches from github) and choosing the stable branch, as explained in the <a href=\"https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R/blob/master/README.md&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qNuXXoMOZbov0B63gW3r-\">README</a>. Please, report any bugs on <a href=\"https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jalvesaq/Nvim-R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493971635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28XwZ7xuIEb_-CdBdwMra_\">github repository</a>. You may also want to subscribe to the notification of new releases by clicking on the <b>Watch</b> button.</div><div><br></div><div>The changes in this new version are:</div><div><ul style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:2em\"><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">New command \\su (send all lines above the current one).</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">New command \\m (send lines from motion command).</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">New option: R_disable_cmds.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">New option: R_after_ob_open.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">R_after_start is a list now.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Recommend Visidata and delete option R_csv_warn.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Delete command triggered by <code style=\"padding:0.2em 0.4em;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">&lt;LocalLeader&gt;tp</code>.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Delete options R_args_in_stline, R_sttline_fmt, R_show_args, R_complete and Rtools_path.</font></li><li style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0.25em\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Limited support for debugging R functions.</font></li></ul><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Best regards,</font></div></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Jakson Aquino</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
